<title>JAPAN: Juroku Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Juroku Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    60.32		vs	   72.61</p>
<p> Operating	   10.44		vs	    9.40</p>
<p> Current		3.69		vs	    6.40</p>
<p> Net		    3.80		vs	    2.74</p>
<p> EPS		   10.37 yen	  vs	    8.85 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    367 million	  vs	 309 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Juroku Bank Ltd is a Gifu-based regional bank.</p>
